@startuml
title Phase 2: extension contracts and plugin assembly
package "Host / composition root" as Host
package "CLI invoker" as CLI
package "Extension contracts / registry" as Core
package "Public domain / session / history" as Domain
package "Built-in shapes and commands" as Builtins
package "stats / dir / box / tree-star" as Plugins
package "XML / filesystem adapters" as IO
Host --> Core : stage, validate, commit
Host --> Builtins : default assembly
Host --> Plugins : code assembly
Host --> Plugins : configuration / module resolution
Host --> IO : inject services
Host --> CLI : start
CLI --> Core : lookup and execute
Builtins --> Core : implement contracts
Builtins --> Domain
Plugins --> Core : public API
Plugins --> Domain : public domain methods
IO --> Domain
Domain ..> Core : ShapeFactory uses interface types
note bottom of Plugins
No imports of host or other plugin internals.
New plugins do not modify the renderer or kernel.
end note
@enduml
